Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the world is so chaotic and cruel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I boring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, I've said enough about Providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You need my food, not my words. It speaks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All my talk of Providence may fill my guests before they start eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I'll be quiet.
